# Third-Party Licences

This file lists the licences of every third-party dependency compiled into `contextos`, generated from `Cargo.lock` by [`cargo-about`](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about). It does not cover this repository's own code, which is licensed under the terms in [`LICENSE`](LICENSE).

Regenerate after any dependency change with:

```sh
cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md --workspace
```

